[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CharacterSpec" load_steps=2 format=3]

; The hermit in the cave. Given a face of his own because he used to wear the smith's: the
; two are the only people east of the village, and a player who met both saw one person in
; two places. A cast where anybody is a duplicate is a cast the player stops reading.
;
; Long hair and a slate robe - the coldest cloth in dusk16 that is not the gloom's indigo,
; because he lives down there with it.

